 "answer_card": {
  "title": "vspone_block parameter renames (part 2)",
  "answer_md": "- `hv_sds_block_remote_iscsi_port`: `remote_ip_address` → `remote_storage_port_ip_address`\n- `hv_shadow_image_pair`: `pvol_mu_number` → `mirror_unit_number`, `copy_pace_track_size` → `copy_pace`\n- `hv_snapshot`, `hv_snapshot_group`: `mirror_unit_id` → `mirror_unit_number`\n- `hv_storage_port(_facts)`: `ports`/`port` → `port_ids`/`port_id`\n- `hv_vsp_one_server`, `_facts`, `_hba_facts`: `nick_name` → `nickname`\n- `hv_gad`, `hv_gad_facts` outputs: `primary_volume_storage_id` / `secondary_volume_storage_id` → `..._storage_serial_number`\n- `hv_hur` outputs: `pvol_status` → `primary_volume_status`, `svol_status` → `secondary_volume_status`",
  "source_url": "https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/porting_guides/porting_guide_13.html"
